   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\" type=\"1\">\n    <li>Here are two graphs representing functions <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> and <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>. <br><br> <img src=\"exercises/media/21b414648bb3e9c4.svg\" alt=\"A technical graph with a grid. It displays a black oscillating curve and a green oscillating curve. The horizontal axis is labeled with differentials like 'dx', 'dy', 'dz', 'dθ', 'dφ', 'du', 'dv', 'dw'.\"><br><br> <strong>Select the three </strong>statements that are true about functions <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> and <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <ol type=\"a\">\n    <li><span data-math=\"f(0)\">f(0)</span>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<span data-math=\"g(0)\">g(0)</span></li>\n    <li>There are values of <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> where <span data-math=\"f(x)=g(x)\">f(x)=g(x)</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"f(-1)\">f(-1)</span>&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;<span data-math=\"g(-1)\">g(-1)</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"f(-3)\">f(-3)</span>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<span data-math=\"g(4)\">g(4)</span></li>\n  </ol>",
